        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dance Victoria&#8217;s Annual General Meeting will be in-person on Sunday, November 2 at 6:30 pm at Dance Victoria Studios. You are invited to join us as we reflect on Dance Victoria’s 2024/25 season and meet new DV General Manager, Anderson Gomez, and greet new Dance Victoria Board Members. Light refreshments will be offered following the [&hellip;]"
