        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;An Introduction to Contemporary Dance with Kayla Henry Register beginning 10am May 12 Discover the freedom and expression of contemporary dance in this welcoming beginner class! Perfect for those new to dance, this class focuses on contemporary techniques, floor work, and simple choreography. You will work on developing strength, flexibility, balance, and musicality in a supportive [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
